<title>JAPAN: Saibu Gas - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Saibu Gas - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.36		vs	   40.87</p>
<p> Operating	  721    million	  vs	  810    million</p>
<p> Current	  prft 180 million	  vs   loss 324    million</p>
<p> Net		prft 507 million	  vs   loss 324    million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 1.39 yen	  vs     loss 0.89 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    365 million	  vs	 365 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Saibu Gas Co Ltd supplies gas to customers in Kita-Kyushu and Fukuoka.</p>
</text>
